   Q('mcq', 'How have Zoe and Daniel decided to structure their presentation?', 'A', 'We\'ve decided to tell it as a kind of detective story', 'They present it as a detective story.', opts=['as a detective story', 'as a comparison of three scripts', 'as a series of short biographies']),
   Q('mcq', 'According to Zoe, why did the Linear B tablets survive?', 'C', 'they survived because the palace was destroyed by fire, which baked them hard', 'A fire baked the tablets.', opts=['They were stored underground.', 'They were deliberately baked by scribes.', 'A fire at the palace hardened them.']),
   Q('mcq', 'What did Alice Kober\'s triplets show about the language of Linear B?', 'B', 'it proved the language had inflections', 'Word endings changed with grammar.', opts=['It was related to Latin.', 'Word endings changed according to grammar.', 'It was written from right to left.']),
